                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Prime Minister Attlee and President Truman met in Washington from December 4
                    through December 8, 1950. At their first meeting on the afternoon of the fourth
                    the two heads of government mentioned several issues connected with a Japanese
                    peace treaty. The record of this meeting is scheduled for publication in volume
                    III.</p>
            </div>
